  "body": "There are no mentions of Web Sockets in current version of document (4.0)\r\n\r\nAs you can guess - very often Websockets are being a second-class citizen, missing some (or all) security mechanisms of their REST counterparts, like schema validation, 1-time use request tokens, data sanitation and so on.\r\n\r\nI believe '13.5 Web-Sockets' section should be added to standard.\r\n\r\n",
